  <description>
    <p>
      Smart Video Processor tidies up your movie and TV show collection. It recognizes each video
      using online databases, then renames the files so that media servers such as Jellyfin find them,
      adds posters and details, fixes the language of audio and subtitle tracks, joins or splits files
      and converts them to a lighter format, all in one place.
    </p>
  </description>
